abstract: "MindWell is an open-source mental health platform providing trusted, accessible wellbeing support aligned with UN SDG 3 (Good Health & Well-being) and SDG 4 (Quality Education). Features 393 educational disorder guides, 20 non-diagnostic psychometric self-assessments, and a privacy-first local architecture."
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-26"
license: "MIT"
